<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">BE A RUNNER</view><view class="title">成为飞毛腿</view><view class="subtitle">帮同学把东西送到门店，每单都有跑腿费。</view>
<view class="card" wx:if="{{runner && runner.status === 'approved'}}"><view class="row"><view class="service-title">已通过认证</view><view class="tag">可以接单</view></view><view class="muted">你好，{{runner.realName}}。去接单大厅看看有没有顺路的单子。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="hall">进入接单大厅 →</button></view>
<view class="card" wx:elif="{{runner && runner.status === 'pending'}}"><view class="row"><view class="service-title">审核中</view><view class="tag">待审核</view></view><view class="muted">资料已经交上去了，管理员审核通过后就能接单。审核只看一次，通过后证件照片会被立即删除。</view></view>
<view class="card" wx:else><view class="label" wx:if="{{runner && runner.status === 'rejected'}}">上次没通过：{{runner.reason}}</view><view class="label">真实姓名</view><input class="field" placeholder="与身份证一致" maxlength="20" value="{{realName}}" data-key="realName" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">学号</view><input class="field" placeholder="用于核对学生身份" maxlength="20" value="{{schoolId}}" data-key="schoolId" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">身份证照片</view><view class="media" data-key="idCard" bindtap="pick"><view wx:if="{{idCard === 'dev:idCard'}}" class="shot empty">测试占位图</view><image wx:elif="{{idCard}}" class="shot" src="{{idCard}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="shot empty">＋ 上传</view></view><view class="label">学生证照片</view><view class="media" data-key="studentCard" bindtap="pick"><view wx:if="{{studentCard === 'dev:studentCard'}}" class="shot empty">测试占位图</view><image wx:elif="{{studentCard}}" class="shot" src="{{studentCard}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="shot empty">＋ 上传</view></view><view class="meta">证件照片只用于这一次审核，审核结束后原件会被删除，系统里只保留"已核验"标记和你的姓名。</view><button wx:if="{{devLogin}}" class="secondary small" bindtap="skipPhotos">开发期：跳过证件照片</button><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">提交申请</button></view>
<view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view></view>
